		{
			"id": "p3",
			"role": "walkthrough",
			"note": "分四步走讀：宣告容量、複製內容、量長度、印出。特別點出第五行是容量、第六行不能用等號、第七行量到五。",
			"elements": [
				{
					"id": "p3_title",
					"type": "title",
					"text": "宣告、複製、量長度"
				},
				{
					"id": "p3_sub",
					"type": "subtitle",
					"text": "四步看懂一個最小的字串程式"
				},
				{
					"id": "p3_code",
					"type": "code",
					"lang": "c",
					"lines": [
						"#include <stdio.h>",
						"#include <string.h>",
						"",
						"int main() {",
						"    char name[32];",
						"    strcpy(name, \"Alice\");",
						"    printf(\"%s 共 %d 個字\\n\", name, (int)strlen(name));",
						"    return 0;",
						"}"
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "p4",
			"role": "pitfall",
			"note": "收尾三個迷思：等號指定、等號比較、少留一格；以四步流程圖回顧。",
			"elements": [
				{
					"id": "p4_title",
					"type": "title",
					"text": "三個一定會踩的坑"
				},
				{
					"id": "p4_sub",
